exports[`complete help screens > snapshots plain general help 1`] = `
"Liftoff - Mission Control Liftoff 0.10.1 - Initialize a governed application and prepare its local workstation.

Usage
liftoff <command> [options]

Global options
Option: --version | Description: Show the installed Liftoff version
Option: --help | Description: Show general help

Onboarding
Command: init | Description: Initialize a project and prepare its workstation
Command: plan | Description: Preview generated artifacts
Command: migrate | Description: Adopt an existing project

Maintenance
Command: validate | Description: Validate a generated project manifest
Command: update | Description: Reconcile Liftoff-managed core files in a project
Command: upgrade | Description: Replace the supported global npm Liftoff CLI; project templates use update separately
Command: doctor | Description: Check local and project readiness

Reference
Command: help | Description: Show general or command-specific help
Command: patterns | Description: List GenAI patterns
Command: providers | Description: List cloud providers
Command: regions | Description: List or search provider regions

Operations
Command: governance | Description: Inspect deterministic governance activation
Command: dev | Description: Print Docker Compose helper commands
Command: infra | Description: Print OpenTofu helper commands

[info] Tip: Run \`liftoff help <command>\` for command-specific usage.
"
`;

